{"id":"7dc92d5c1637052d","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-thm-tietze.md","title":"Tietze Extension Theorem","display":"thm-tietze — Tietze Extension Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-tietze","aliases":["58-thm-tietze"],"display":"thm-tietze — Tietze Extension Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-normal-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set]]","[[58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-tietze"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-tietze</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-tietze — Tietze Extension Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c4dd206ee7091798\" href=\"?note=c4dd206ee7091798\" title=\"58-df-normal-space\">58-df-normal-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" href=\"?note=4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"44867449c3df728b\" href=\"?note=44867449c3df728b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map\">58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,A,a,b,f,\\tau_A,\\tau_{[a,b]}\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,A,a,b,f,\\tau_A,\\tau_{[a,b]}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\},\\quad\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\},\\quad\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tietze} \\vdash \\mathrm{Normal}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\land a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\land a\\leq b\\land\\tau_A=\\{U\\cap A\\mid U\\in\\tau\\}\\land\\tau_{[a,b]}=\\{U\\cap[a,b]\\mid U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,[a,b])\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(f,A,\\tau_A,[a,b],\\tau_{[a,b]})\\to\\exists F\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(F,X,[a,b])\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(F,X,\\tau,[a,b],\\tau_{[a,b]})\\land F\\upharpoonright A=f\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tietze} \\vdash \\mathrm{Normal}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\land a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\land a\\leq b\\land\\tau_A=\\{U\\cap A\\mid U\\in\\tau\\}\\land\\tau_{[a,b]}=\\{U\\cap[a,b]\\mid U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,[a,b])\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(f,A,\\tau_A,[a,b],\\tau_{[a,b]})\\to\\exists F\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(F,X,[a,b])\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(F,X,\\tau,[a,b],\\tau_{[a,b]})\\land F\\upharpoonright A=f\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Tietze: continuous functions on closed subsets extend to the whole normal space.</li>\n<li>Urysohn's lemma follows from this.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-normal-space","status":"resolved","id":"c4dd206ee7091798","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-normal-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set","status":"resolved","id":"4dc8b2d2e69010a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map","status":"resolved","id":"44867449c3df728b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,A,a,b,f,\\tau_A,\\tau_{[a,b]}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\},\\quad\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tietze} \\vdash \\mathrm{Normal}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\land a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\land a\\leq b\\land\\tau_A=\\{U\\cap A\\mid U\\in\\tau\\}\\land\\tau_{[a,b]}=\\{U\\cap[a,b]\\mid U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,[a,b])\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(f,A,\\tau_A,[a,b],\\tau_{[a,b]})\\to\\exists F\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(F,X,[a,b])\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(F,X,\\tau,[a,b],\\tau_{[a,b]})\\land F\\upharpoonright A=f\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1253,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4463","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-thm-tietze.md|58-thm-tietze]]（batch05）"}],"outgoi